{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676060/extras/itch_banner.png?t=1747240057\" /><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>half-a-cado\u00a0</strong>is a  puzzle game where you control a numbered cube rolling through grid-based levels filled with mathematical operations. Each move changes your cube's value as you interact with different tiles. Plan your path carefully, solve the mathematical challenges, and reach the goal in as few moves as possible in this uniquely satisfying puzzle experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676060/extras/gif_1.gif?t=1747240057\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roll &amp; Calculate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every operation tile changes your value in increasingly complex ways. Work out the most efficient path to reach the target number!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676060/extras/gif_2.gif?t=1747240057\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Five Worlds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore 5 different vegetable themed worlds. Each one introducing a new mathematical operation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676060/extras/gif_3.gif?t=1747240057\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Increasing Complexity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn about a range of different mathematical operations including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Addition / Subtraction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplication / Division</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Squares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Factorials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modulos</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676060/extras/debris_banner.png?t=1747240057\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are a two man game studio making one game a month! We've made 5 games so far and this is the first one we are putting on Steam. Stay tuned for more games!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3676060?t=1747240057","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676060/73bca390bfced0b102fdb07f2f1a00f2817ed33e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747240057","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676060/49fe1832fbe27b7c58862724d7ea9a718f45aaaf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747240057","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676060/49fe1832fbe27b7c58862724d7ea9a718f45aaaf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747240057","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676060/extras/itch_banner.png?t=1747240057\" /><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>half-a-cado\u00a0</strong>is a  puzzle game where you control a numbered cube rolling through grid-based levels filled with mathematical operations. Each move changes your cube's value as you interact with different tiles. Plan your path carefully, solve the mathematical challenges, and reach the goal in as few moves as possible in this uniquely satisfying puzzle experience!</p><p cla